    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In a world where the fae-touched fall prey to a sinister killer, only a faeologist can uncover the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/fe4afcf7e23c8991891518b9ff16c183.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/13d37c32447d7408b0a524e4318d9b96.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.mp4?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick dialogue options that will lead you to certain endings, including romantic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/b50dd5feb3c9d0ec2cc1988bcaaafc8a.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/b50dd5feb3c9d0ec2cc1988bcaaafc8a.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/b50dd5feb3c9d0ec2cc1988bcaaafc8a.mp4?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact using your tools to investigate the evidence. You have a magnifying glass, a blacklight to detect faerie magic, and a faerie encyclopedia at your disposal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/c5ac2ce7b117bee00b6792479f0f0b69.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/c5ac2ce7b117bee00b6792479f0f0b69.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/c5ac2ce7b117bee00b6792479f0f0b69.mp4?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interview select characters to gather crucial information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/cddfe11e453e7014ed1aea36d488efed.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/cddfe11e453e7014ed1aea36d488efed.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/cddfe11e453e7014ed1aea36d488efed.mp4?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Present your findings to the detective.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genderless protagonist with a customizable name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between rekindling your past romance with <strong>the detective</strong> (M), indulging in the mature charm of your <strong>patron</strong> (M), nurturing a gothic romance with <strong>the assistant</strong> (F), straying your <strong>childhood friend</strong> (F) into an intoxicating love, or simply being contented with yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various endings depending on your choices and the accuracy of your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/8519aa99f9fcea232b00214f13fa75cc.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a renowned faeologist in 1920s New York who has\u00a0been tasked with solving a chilling crime:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;Bizarre murders happening across the upper echelons of New York society, with the mystery deepening with every clue.&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues with your fae expertise and keen investigative tools such as a magnifying glass and a blacklight, and gather vital information by interviewing those who hold fragments of the truth, all while navigating your allegiance between a relentless detective and your enigmatic patron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the truth and cement the importance of faeology in a world that relegates it to the realm of pseudoscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/77ac659e24c8f6cf79cc3fd03e264ef9.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short introduction to the four love interests in Death &amp; Faeology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/ffec8dc68cd993d48eb408c0d50a2f5f.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=1800 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>In a world where the fae-touched fall prey to a sinister killer, only a faeologist can uncover the truth.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/fe4afcf7e23c8991891518b9ff16c183.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/13d37c32447d7408b0a524e4318d9b96.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/31ce38e0827fb6e487e661db3d9e9b65.mp4?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick dialogue options that will lead you to certain endings, including romantic ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/b50dd5feb3c9d0ec2cc1988bcaaafc8a.poster.avif?t=1753390550\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/b50dd5feb3c9d0ec2cc1988bcaaafc8a.webm?t=1753390550\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=v