/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genderless protagonist with a customizable name.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between rekindling your past romance with <strong>the detective</strong> (M), indulging in the mature charm of your <strong>patron</strong> (M), nurturing a gothic romance with <strong>the assistant</strong> (F), straying your <strong>childhood friend</strong> (F) into an intoxicating love, or simply being contented with yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various endings depending on your choices and the accuracy of your deduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/8519aa99f9fcea232b00214f13fa75cc.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a renowned faeologist in 1920s New York who has\u00a0been tasked with solving a chilling crime:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>&quot;Bizarre murders happening across the upper echelons of New York society, with the mystery deepening with every clue.&quot;</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the clues with your fae expertise and keen investigative tools such as a magnifying glass and a blacklight, and gather vital information by interviewing those who hold fragments of the truth, all while navigating your allegiance between a relentless detective and your enigmatic patron.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the truth and cement the importance of faeology in a world that relegates it to the realm of pseudoscience?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/77ac659e24c8f6cf79cc3fd03e264ef9.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short introduction to the four love interests in Death &amp; Faeology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3369020/extras/ffec8dc68cd993d48eb408c0d50a2f5f.avif?t=1753390550\" data-has-big width=800 height=1800 /></span></p>",
